l (20% sparsity, post-prune 1% GSM8K) GRPO recovery with max_completion_length=4096 (fix D009 truncation). Negative control — expected to fail recovery due to non-optimal structure selection, confirming RASP advantage. ← 基于 mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\n- **grpo_standard_20_fast** (negative): Standard-pruned model (20% sparsity, post-prune 1% GSM8K) expected to fail GRPO recovery (RewardDesertCallback triggers). This is the negative control — confirms RASP's structure selection enables recovery that standard pruning cannot. ← 基于 mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\n\n## 趋势\n成功 0 / 负向 4 / 失败 3 / 共 9\n\n## 下一步\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\n\n## 资源状态\nwestb-23072: 无 GPU 信息\n\n## 告警\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline: 训练失败 — unknown\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\n- grpo_rasp_20: 已被终止 — unknown\n- grpo_standard_20: 已被终止 — unknown\n- grpo_rasp_20_4096: 训练失败 — unknown\n","numLines":34,"startLine":1,"totalLines":34}}}
